    "The source archive had no public download URL in Source0."
  ],
  "fix": [
    "Apply server credit before callbacks, preserve grants during delivery and serialize default-deficit selection/write enqueue/accounting.",
    "Retain only20 runtime example files, pin their distribution interpreter paths, retain all license/metadata paths with deduplicated storage, and identify the actual OBS source URL."
